      <!-- N3 (new, diplomacy, 60d — nuclear framework Aug 18) -->
      <div class="forecast-card cat-diplomacy status-ACTIVE">
        <div class="fc-head">
          <span class="fc-id">N3 · 2026-06-19-iran-us-nuclear-framework-by-aug-18</span>
          <span class="fc-category">diplomacy</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fc-question">Will the US-Iran 60-day MOU structured negotiations produce a signed nuclear framework agreement (covering HEU limits and permanent Hormuz status) before EOD 2026-08-18?</div>
        <div class="fc-probrow">
          <span class="fc-p">20%</span>
          <span class="fc-delta no-move">new forecast (prior: 20%)</span>
          <span class="fc-horizon">→ resolves by 2026-08-18</span>
